00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:53.860
In the stall we live
like pigs

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:58.180
Hungry as dogs are we

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:01.460
A child
without a mother

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:04.420
A mother without child

00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:07.580
Where is our homeland?

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:10.780
When will we return?

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:14.260
Jews, o Jews, o how
we suffer

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:17.980
Nothing like it was ever known

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:21.140
The tears we've wept

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:24.100
Could be rivers

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:27.300
The blood we've spilled

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:29.900
Could be an ocean

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:33.060
The tears we've wept

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:36.140
Could be rivers

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:38.940
The blood
we've spilled

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:41.980
Could be an ocean

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:43.500
That's it.

